{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ehDdnUcnql1793701662.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>漁護署與17間動物福利機構，合作推廣領養計劃。</p><p></p><p>其中位於元朗錦田的阿棍屋高埔狗狗領養中心，收留了多隻被棄養或流浪狗，漁護署目前有4間動物管理中心負責接收遺失或流浪動物。最新與多間機構合作，為這些動物治病、訓練，更會幫牠們美容護理。經獸醫師評估適合領養後，就會轉交至機構，予市民領養。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pHi8KT84CC1793701669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>申請領養的市民需接受家訪，和親自接觸該動物3次以上，確保動物不會再被遺棄。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1730_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oMhHlMAPYO1793701680.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:59.854097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:58:20.246778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:44.512924+00:00","content_hash":"a8cc2a7cf93095d90645dd109763592e630e9422db249d14d7891c138a93b7f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:59.854097+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}